  {"question": "Which consulting agency in arXiv 2401.14462 is noted for helping companies comply with legal requirements and focuses on fairness for protected groups?", "answer": "Eticas is noted for helping companies comply with legal requirements and champions fairness for protected groups.", "evidence": [{"page": 30, "quote": "| Motivation            | help companies comply with legal require- ments, security and data protection, fairness, bias and model accuracy                                                                |"}, {"page": 30, "quote": "| Institutional context | The consulting agency champions fairness for protected groups, yet also safeguards corporations from financial and reputational risks.                                          |"}]},
